WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:06.422
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.880
Each season, I want to introduce you

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.060
to some new aspect of what we're calling home.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.030
And in season two, I wanted to add the attic to this.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:25.190
[FOOTSTEPS]

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.110
I was lucky enough to direct this episode

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.680
and got to design the attic.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.950
And I remember showing this episode to my family.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.020
And they all gasped when the door opened.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:36.980
[DOOR CLICKS OPENS]

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.780
Where's Jericho?

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.700
I don't know.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.550
Well, you'll stay here till you remember.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.610
The attic has a symbolic representation that it's

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:47.990
the highest point in the house.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:52.342
And now Leanne is in the highest point in the house.

00:00:52.342 --> 00:00:54.214
[CLICKING]

00:00:56.505 --> 00:00:57.880
With regard to Sean and Leanne, I

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.250
think that they've always had some kind of honesty

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:00.820
about them.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.680
They're honest with each other.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:06.100
Tell me who you're looking for.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.860
Jericho.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:12.720
Jericho died, Mr. Turner.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:16.950
Sean is drawn to this person that he can tell the truth to.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.590
And because of the kindness he shows her,

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.782
it seems that positive things are happening to him.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.240
Did you put scotch bonnets in this?

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:26.962
Hmm, you guessed.

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:29.440
Darling, you can taste.

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:38.270
It's a very interesting dynamic because there's kind of almost

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:42.440
like liaisons -- alliances that are being made in this episode,

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.760
Dorothy on one side--

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:47.360
What did you do with--

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.900
--and Leanne and Sean start to become an alliance on another.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.880
What did you do?

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.810
And you see that the stakes are extremely high for this family.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:57.896
This is too far.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:05.690
Nothing is too far.

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:08.440
[MUSIC PLAYING]

